    "Hi! Could you turn on App Store Connect's analytics reports for %@? It takes an Admin API key and a single request per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOr open Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) with your Admin key once: it sends that request and doesn't keep the key. Thanks!": {
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hola! Podries activar els informes d'analítica d'App Store Connect per a %@? Cal una clau d'API d'administrador i una sola sol·licitud per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nO obre Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) un cop amb la teva clau d'administrador: envia aquesta sol·licitud i no guarda la clau. Gràcies!"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hallo! Könntest du die Analyseberichte von App Store Connect für %@ einschalten? Dafür braucht es einen Admin-API-Schlüssel und eine einzige Anfrage pro App:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOder öffne Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) einmal mit deinem Admin-Schlüssel: Es sendet diese Anfrage und behält den Schlüssel nicht. Danke!"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "¡Hola! ¿Podrías activar los informes de analíticas de App Store Connect para %@? Hace falta una clave de API de administrador y una sola solicitud por app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nO abre Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) una vez con tu clave de administrador: envía esa solicitud y no guarda la clave. ¡Gracias!"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour ! Pourriez-vous activer les rapports d'analyse d'App Store Connect pour %@ ? Il faut une clé d'API Admin et une seule requête par app :\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOu ouvrez Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) une fois avec votre clé Admin : il envoie cette requête et ne garde pas la clé. Merci !"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ciao! Potresti attivare i report di analisi di App Store Connect per %@? Serve una chiave API Admin e una sola richiesta per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOppure apri Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) una volta con la tua chiave Admin: invia quella richiesta e non conserva la chiave. Grazie!"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hoi! Kun je de analyserapporten van App Store Connect aanzetten voor %@? Daarvoor is een beheerders-API-sleutel nodig en één verzoek per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOf open Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) één keer met je beheerderssleutel: het stuurt dat verzoek en bewaart de sleutel niet. Bedankt!"
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oi! Você poderia ativar os relatórios de análise do App Store Connect para %@? É preciso uma chave de API de administrador e uma única solicitação por app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOu abra o Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) uma vez com a sua chave de administrador: ele envia essa solicitação e não guarda a chave. Obrigado!"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Привет! Не мог бы ты включить отчёты аналитики App Store Connect для %@? Нужен API-ключ администратора и один запрос на приложение:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nИли открой Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) один раз со своим ключом администратора: он отправит этот запрос и не сохранит ключ. Спасибо!"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merhaba! %@ için App Store Connect analiz raporlarını açabilir misin? Bir Yönetici API anahtarı ve uygulama başına tek bir istek gerekiyor:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nYa da Vane'i (github.com/adrbn/vane) Yönetici anahtarınla bir kez aç: bu isteği gönderir ve anahtarı saklamaz. Teşekkürler!"
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hej! Kan du slå på App Store Connects analysrapporter för %@? Det kräver en Admin-API-nyckel och en enda begäran per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nEller öppna Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) med din Admin-nyckel en gång: den skickar begäran och sparar inte nyckeln. Tack!"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hei! Kan du slå på App Store Connects analyserapporter for %@? Det krever en Admin-API-nøkkel og én enkelt forespørsel per app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nEller åpne Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) med Admin-nøkkelen din én gang: den sender forespørselen og beholder ikke nøkkelen. Takk!"
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hej! Kan du slå App Store Connects analyserapporter til for %@? Det kræver en Admin-API-nøgle og én enkelt anmodning pr. app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nEller åbn Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) med din Admin-nøgle én gang: den sender anmodningen og gemmer ikke nøglen. Tak!"
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hei! Voisitko ottaa App Store Connectin analytiikkaraportit käyttöön sovellukselle %@? Se vaatii Admin-API-avaimen ja yhden pyynnön per sovellus:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nTai avaa Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) kerran Admin-avaimellasi: se lähettää pyynnön eikä säilytä avainta. Kiitos!"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cześć! Czy mógłbyś włączyć raporty analityczne App Store Connect dla %@? Wymaga to klucza API Admin i jednego żądania na aplikację:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nAlbo otwórz Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) raz ze swoim kluczem Admin: wyśle to żądanie i nie zachowa klucza. Dzięki!"
          }
        },
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dobrý den! Mohli byste zapnout analytické přehledy App Store Connect pro %@? Vyžaduje to klíč API Admin a jeden požadavek na aplikaci:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nNebo jednou otevřete Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) se svým klíčem Admin: odešle tento požadavek a klíč si nenechá. Díky!"
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salut! Ai putea activa rapoartele de analiză din App Store Connect pentru %@? Este nevoie de o cheie API de administrator și de o singură solicitare pe aplicație:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nSau deschide o dată Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) cu cheia ta de administrator: trimite acea solicitare și nu păstrează cheia. Mulțumesc!"
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Привіт! Чи не могли б ви ввімкнути звіти аналітики App Store Connect для %@? Для цього потрібен ключ API адміністратора й один запит на застосунок:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nАбо один раз відкрийте Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) зі своїм ключем адміністратора: він надішле цей запит і не збереже ключ. Дякую!"
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Γεια σας! Θα μπορούσατε να ενεργοποιήσετε τις αναφορές αναλύσεων του App Store Connect για το %@; Χρειάζεται ένα κλειδί API διαχειριστή και ένα μόνο αίτημα ανά εφαρμογή:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nΉ ανοίξτε μία φορά το Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) με το κλειδί διαχειριστή: στέλνει αυτό το αίτημα και δεν κρατά το κλειδί. Ευχαριστώ!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你好！能否为 %@ 开启 App Store Connect 的分析报告？这需要一个管理员 API 密钥，并为每个 App 发送一次请求：\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\n或者用你的管理员密钥打开一次 Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane)：它会发送该请求，并且不会保留密钥。谢谢！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你好！能否為 %@ 開啟 App Store Connect 的分析報告？這需要一個管理員 API 金鑰，並為每個 App 傳送一次請求：\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\n或者用你的管理員金鑰開啟一次 Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane)：它會傳送該請求，並且不會保留金鑰。謝謝！"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "こんにちは！%@のApp Store Connectの分析レポートを有効にしていただけませんか？管理者APIキーが必要で、Appごとに1回のリクエストを送るだけです:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nまたは、管理者キーでVane (github.com/adrbn/vane)を一度開いてください。Vaneがそのリクエストを送信し、キーは保持しません。よろしくお願いします！"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "안녕하세요! %@에 대해 App Store Connect 분석 보고서를 켜 주실 수 있나요? 관리자 API 키가 필요하고, 앱마다 요청 한 번이면 돼요.\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\n또는 관리자 키로 Vane(github.com/adrbn/vane)을 한 번 열어 주세요. 요청을 보내고 키는 보관하지 않아요. 감사합니다!"
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "สวัสดี! ช่วยเปิดรายงานการวิเคราะห์ของ App Store Connect สำหรับ %@ ได้ไหม ต้องใช้คีย์ API ของผู้ดูแลระบบและส่งคำขอเพียงครั้งเดียวต่อแอป:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nหรือเปิด Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) ด้วยคีย์ผู้ดูแลระบบหนึ่งครั้ง Vane จะส่งคำขอนั้นและไม่เก็บคีย์ไว้ ขอบคุณ!"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Olá! Podia ativar os relatórios de análises do App Store Connect para %@? É preciso uma chave API de administrador e um único pedido por app:\n\nPOST https://api.appstoreconnect.apple.com/v1/analyticsReportRequests\n{\"data\":{\"type\":\"analyticsReportRequests\",\"attributes\":{\"accessType\":\"ONGOING\"},\"relationships\":{\"app\":{\"data\":{\"type\":\"apps\",\"id\":\"APP_ID\"}}}}}\n\nOu abra o Vane (github.com/adrbn/vane) uma vez com a sua chave de administrador: ele envia esse pedido e não guarda a chave. Obrigado!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
